# This folder is the whole project: private notes, test builds, backups, samples and so on.
# Only the files named below ever go to GitHub. Everything else is ignored, so a new file
# can never be uploaded by mistake. To publish a new file, add a line here first.
/*
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/source/
/source/*
!/source/FiveMToolbox.cs
!/source/app.ico
!/source/build.ps1
!/source/build-and-run.bat
!/source/make-icon.ps1
